    "Description": "A color photograph taken inside the Pullen Park Carousel house of 2 horses and 2 cats. From left to right: the head and part of the chest of a brown horse; the front half of a yellow horse with a white/yellow mane; a brown and white cat with a fish in its mouth that has a blue-green harness, a green saddle blanket, and a brown saddle; a gray cat with a green saddle blanket. In the background, two ostriches and a pig are visible.\n\nReverse is white with gold text reading \"Kodak-Official Sponsor of the Olympic Games\" with the Olympic rings and \"Kodak Royal Paper.\" Black printed text reads \"<No.3A>515 21+00 NNNNN+19AU 0143.\"",
